  "findings": [
    "Events have ordered global SQLite ids; do not assume IDs are consecutive within a run.",
    "controller_decision records intent; dispatch records actual delegation. Rejected decisions must not create executed task nodes.",
    "plan_revision carries added task definitions or cancelled task_ids. task_result is the committed worker result, not model_response.",
    "model_response status responded means transport completed, not task success. A later format_error may invalidate that response.",
    "Existing records have verification end events but no verification_started. Old history cannot reconstruct exact start time; do not fabricate it.",
    "Final acceptance is authoritative only from verification.isolated/exit_code/status/hash. started/preparing must not assert Docker execution."
  ]
}